==Icelandic==
===Etymology===
From {{term|vit||mind|lang=is}} + {{term|-laus||[[-less]], free of something, without|lang=is}}. Literally meaning "without one's mind". Compare the word {{term|vitskertur||insane|lang=is}}.
===Adjective===
'''vitlaus''' {{m|f}}, [[vitlaust]] {{n}}

# [[insane]], [[crazy]]
# [[wrong]], [[incorrect]]
#: ''Þetta svar er '''vitlaust'''.''
#:: This answer is '''incorrect'''.
# [[dumb]], [[stupid]]
#: ''Svakalega eru [[dúfa|dúfur]] '''vitlaus''' dýr.''
#:: Pigeons are such '''dumb''' animals.

====Synonyms====
*{{sense|crazy}} [[vitskertur]] {{m}}, [[vitskert]] {{f|n}}
